        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-206, Floral Southwest Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Southwest Flower Cabinet Knob features geometric shapes that make-up and flatter the floral design in the center. The interesting combination of shapes is aesthetically pleasing to the eye. It is the perfect accent to almost any ranch or southwest style home. Available in 6 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching:<a href=\"/products/southwest-flower-with-square-pattern-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-406\"><b>CP-406 Southwest Flower Cabinet Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/southwest-flower-drop-pull-rk-international-cp-864\"><b>CP-864 Southwest Flower Drop Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CK-206 Flower Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/norton-closer-arms.jpg?v=1704354564\" width=\"599\" height=\"123\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
